{"text": "Still not 24.", "start": 1597, "end": 1610, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let me try another approach.", "start": 1612, "end": 1640, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's think about fractions.", "start": 1641, "end": 1669, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Maybe divide some numbers to get fractions.", "start": 1670, "end": 1713, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "For example, 8 divided by (13 - 6) = 8 / 7.", "start": 1714, "end": 1757, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Then 3 * that?", "start": 1758, "end": 1772, "label": "setQuestion"}
{"text": "3 * (8 / 7) is 24/7, which is not helpful.", "start": 1773, "end": 1815, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Alternatively, 6 divided by (13 - 8) = 6 / 5 = 1.2.", "start": 1817, "end": 1868, "label": "inform"}
